= Memel Revolt


A Lithuanian revolt has broken out in the independent Versailles mandate territory of Memeland (Klaipėda). The troops stationed there don't make any moves to resist it and a provisional administration has been set up to pave the way for joining Lithuania.

It is expected that the territory will be given some autonomy within Lithuania. There isn't that much we can or do about this now.




















  
